# SolarEPC-Pro Expert Edition Walkthrough

I have upgraded the platform to the **Expert Edition**, featuring physical realism, commercial depth, and a premium UI.

## New Features (Phase 7)
- **Horizon Shading**: Model mountains/buildings blocking the sun.
- **Complex Tariffs**: Time-of-Use (TOU) and Demand Charges.
- **Civil BOM**: Estimate Fence, Trenching, Concrete, and Roads.
- **Battery Physics**: SOH degradation based on throughput.
- **Premium UI**:
    - **CAD Layout**: Visualizes individual modules.
    - **Professional Graphs**: Stacked Area, Waterfall charts.
    - **Dashboard**: Cleaner metrics and layout.

## Previous Features (Phases 1-6)
- **SaaS**: Database, Optimization, Microgrid, GIS, AI.
- **Enterprise**: Real-World Weather, Equipment DB.
- **Professional**: Inverter/Cable Sizing, Geometry, Financials.

